/**
 * The tutorial recordings.
 *
 * Files live in static/videos/ and are served from /videos/ — Gatsby copies
 * everything under static/ to the site root verbatim, so the path here is the
 * published path, not the source one.
 *
 * DURATIONS ARE NOT LISTED HERE ON PURPOSE. A hand-typed runtime goes stale the
 * first time a clip is re-recorded, and a tutorial page that says 1:20 over a
 * 2:05 video is a small, avoidable lie. The page reads the real duration from
 * each file's metadata instead, which costs a few kilobytes per video and can
 * never disagree with what actually plays.
 *
 * THE RECORDINGS HAVE NO AUDIO. That is deliberate — they are silent
 * walkthroughs — but a viewer who does not know will assume their sound is
 * broken and go looking. Every entry is flagged so the page can say so before
 * anyone presses play.
 */

